the bogus skill \"Fruitmaster,\" which is completely unsuited to combat. Eating a second skill fruit results in death. Unable to try again, Light resigns himself to becoming a fruit farmer. Meanwhile, his childhood friend Lena gains the \"Sword Saint\" skill and debuts as an adventurer. One night, Light accidentally eats a second skill fruit, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vMe15txW08UJty137E9HY4O5TtH.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18675","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"178100","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"59002","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"276204","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"450933","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"87657","synopsis":"Light becomes an adventurer and is reunited with Lena, now a rank S adventurer, at the guild. However, she acts coldly towards him, and Light is bewildered. The truth is the direction and thinking of Lena's party does not match her own, and she suffers every day. When Light learns about their cruelty, he decides to rescue Lena and have her join his party.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/l6YoD9N7YEK2Me4LgWVLQrE0PY8.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18675","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"178100","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"59002","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"276204","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"450933","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"87766","synopsis":"Light, Lena, and Ayla are hired by the guild to figure out why some adventurers went missing and find them. When they arrive at the count's manor that is th